      <activity id="04d007a5-5ebb-5dc0-aa7c-50135de25b65" activityNameId="79c1811b-1fd8-5201-ac8c-e935a6978e08" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, wood-metal, natural/varnished, U=1.1 W/m2K, m2 visible, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, wood-metal, natural/varnished, U=1.1 W/m2K, m2 visible, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The average visible area is 0.29m2. 1m2 of visible wood-metal window frame weighs 139.2kg. The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: 6da5d6e4-a014-3d2b-8ac2-c82b2893db19
Included are the materials used in a wooden-metal window frame with surface treatment and the panelling of casement and frame. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6da5d6e4-a014-3d2b-8ac2-c82b2893db19.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
